<title>UK: UK December M0 data to be released on January 6.</title>
<headline>UK December M0 data to be released on January 6.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK December M0 money supply data, originally scheduled for release today, will now be published on January 6, the Bank of England said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
